            <title>[IGNITE-2156] .Net: add IgniteClientDisconnectedException to the .Net API</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2156</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Java API has IgniteClientDisconnectedException that lets to take a reference to the future and wait for client reconnection.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;.Net API should be improved by adding the same functionality&lt;br/&gt;
